 *   fib4(n) = fib4(n-1) + fib4(n-2) + fib4(n-3) + fib4(n-4)   for n ≥ 4
 *
 * The implementation uses an iterative approach with constant space,
 * avoiding recursion and ensuring efficient computation even for large n.
