 * Find all coordinates of the value `x` in a jagged 2‑D array.
 *
 * @param {Array<Array<*>>} lst - The jagged array (matrix).
 * @param {*} x - The value to search for.
 * @returns {Array<Array<number>>} An array of [row, column] pairs.
